    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just that i'm watching though. it feels like i've seen too much to ever really go back. like i'm part of something else and this civilian life is just... fake. i don't even want to try and \"reconnect\" anymore. what's the point of pretending to inhabit a world that doesn't even mean anything to me?",
